Greg Kerr
GKUpload v4.06 - A file area management program for TransAmiga
    Gkupload is a file maintenance program to be used with TransAmiga1.1
    major features:
                1] read TransAmiga configuration files to find library
                   names, Paths to file areas and the Sysop's name

                2] if a file does not have a description GKupload will ask
                   for a comment and will then write a desc file and add a
                   filenote to this file.

                3] it will remember any uploader and the comments already
                   made by the Uploader.

                4] so many other features that I can't remember them all.

                5] Added code to create a list for each area, This allows
                   the writing of a script to create a files list for
                   download within TransAmiga.
